{"version":1,"content":"<p>加拿大流行天王The Weeknd昨晚（24日）在啟德體育園主場館，展開《After Hours Til Dawn Tour》香港站首場演出。</p><p>其後The Weeknd在Instagram上載演唱會片段，可見大屏幕配有巨型「HONG KONG」字及播放香港不同景觀，其中聯乘了樂壇天后王菲的廣東歌代表作之一《季候風》。</p><p>截至今日早上11時16分，該片段已獲得54.6萬人次讚好（Likes），逾5000留言。</p><p>［IG片段］</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:06.461597+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:42:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:58:06.358392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799254+00:00","content_hash":"9823350b62c7b05d8dc172a36b057e8d01ca8ae0f56ae34aa5ec6926a1bab847","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}